      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Addendum three: it works fine setting the properties by name instead of int ID, meaning Shader.PropertyToID isn't consistent between the editor and live VRC, which is *weird* because most of the SpeedTree stuff looks to have bespoke IDs assigned to it.  Still; could we maybe get Udon support for the function to avoid issues like this in the future?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
